WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.901 --> 00:00:02.601
-Welcome back, everybody.

00:00:02.601 --> 00:00:05.501
Questlove and I are about
to play a frightening new game.

00:00:05.501 --> 00:00:06.734
Do you know what the game is?
-We are?

00:00:06.734 --> 00:00:08.200
I have no clue...
-It's a frightening new game.

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:10.067
This is called
the "Jump Scare Challenge."

00:00:10.067 --> 00:00:11.467
Here we go.

00:00:11.467 --> 00:00:14.234
-♪ Jump Scare Challenge ♪

00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:16.734
♪ Jump Scare Challenge ♪

00:00:16.734 --> 00:00:20.234
♪ Oh, yeah ♪

00:00:20.234 --> 00:00:22.300
-You didn't even know you were
playing this until just now.

00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:23.634
-Oh, man.
-I'm so excited.

00:00:23.634 --> 00:00:25.601
But we're going to need
another player, everyone.

00:00:25.601 --> 00:00:28.167
You can see him
in the scary new movie "Nope,"

00:00:28.167 --> 00:00:30.801
which is out this Friday
in theaters and IMAX.

00:00:30.801 --> 00:00:33.300
Give it up for Daniel Kaluuya!

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:34.968
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:34.968 --> 00:00:37.133
♪♪

00:00:37.133 --> 00:00:40.234
Yeah. Yeah. He's feeling it.
Yeah, that's right.

00:00:40.234 --> 00:00:42.701
That's right.
You know what I'm saying.

00:00:42.701 --> 00:00:45.300
Come on. Good to see you.
Good to see you, buddy.

00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:46.901
Alright.

00:00:46.901 --> 00:00:48.868
Daniel, you can have a seat
right here, bud.

00:00:48.868 --> 00:00:50.567
Take that.
Have a seat right there.

00:00:50.567 --> 00:00:52.267
Now, here's how
this is going to work.

00:00:52.267 --> 00:00:53.968
We're all going to watch
a jump-scare video

00:00:53.968 --> 00:00:55.634
together at the same time.
-Yeah.

00:00:55.634 --> 00:00:58.467
-Whoever can keep
their composure the most

00:00:58.467 --> 00:01:00.167
and react the least

00:01:00.167 --> 00:01:02.667
when the jump scare happens
wins that round.

00:01:02.667 --> 00:01:05.033
-Alright. Cool.
Alright. Cool. I got ya.

00:01:05.033 --> 00:01:07.667
-I feel like you're
going to be good at this.

00:01:07.667 --> 00:01:08.834
-I'm going to be good.
-Alright, alright.

00:01:08.834 --> 00:01:10.767
Everyone put on a --
We have monitors here.

00:01:10.767 --> 00:01:12.634
Alright. Everyone
put on their headphones.

00:01:12.634 --> 00:01:13.934
There's a left and right side.

00:01:13.934 --> 00:01:14.968
-Yeah.
-Yeah, I got you.

00:01:14.968 --> 00:01:17.133
Alright, here we go.
Alright. Alright.

00:01:17.133 --> 00:01:18.467
I can't hear anything.

00:01:18.467 --> 00:01:21.400
Alright.
Let's play the first video.

00:01:21.400 --> 00:01:22.767
[ Sweet flute music plays ]

00:01:22.767 --> 00:01:24.267
[ Audience laughter ]

00:01:24.267 --> 00:01:25.767
-I'm scared already.

00:01:25.767 --> 00:01:27.901
-Wait. Why is the audience
reacting like that?

00:01:27.901 --> 00:01:29.767
-Pay attention.
-Are they watching?

00:01:29.767 --> 00:01:31.767
They're watching it.
Are you guys watching it?

00:01:31.767 --> 00:01:32.868
-Audience: Yeah.

00:01:32.868 --> 00:01:35.100
-I know something's
going to happen.

00:01:35.100 --> 00:01:36.667
-[ Creature screams ]
-Aah!

00:01:36.667 --> 00:01:37.734
[ Laughter ]

00:01:37.734 --> 00:01:39.834
[Bleep]
Oh, wait. I'm sorry.

00:01:39.834 --> 00:01:41.200
[Bleep]

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:43.200
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:45.300 --> 00:01:48.801
-Never --
I've never heard you curse.

00:01:48.801 --> 00:01:52.100
-You think he's scared?
-Dude, that was real.

00:01:52.100 --> 00:01:53.767
-You said some crazy curse
in that one. I go...

00:01:53.767 --> 00:01:55.067
-I think I said
three curse words.

00:01:55.067 --> 00:01:56.334
-Yeah, you said
three curse words.

00:01:56.334 --> 00:01:58.367
You made up a new one.
Oh, can we see --

00:01:58.367 --> 00:01:59.767
-No!
-We're going to show

00:01:59.767 --> 00:02:02.167
