and see who reacted.

00:02:04.200 --> 00:02:08.267
[ Laughter ]

00:02:08.267 --> 00:02:10.167
-Bow, bow.
-You were fantastic.

00:02:10.167 --> 00:02:13.634
-But I looked cool, though.
-That's what he is. Cool, man.

00:02:13.634 --> 00:02:15.968
Alright. Alright.
So, the winner --

00:02:15.968 --> 00:02:18.067
The winner is
Daniel there, yeah.

00:02:18.067 --> 00:02:19.367
-Alright.

00:02:19.367 --> 00:02:21.200
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:21.200 --> 00:02:22.501
-Let's go again.
Let's go again.

00:02:22.501 --> 00:02:23.801
-Alright, man.
Here we go. Ready?

00:02:23.801 --> 00:02:26.200
Play the second video.
Here we go.

00:02:26.200 --> 00:02:27.501
[ Ominous music plays ]

00:02:27.501 --> 00:02:29.000
