-Aah!

00:02:54.501 --> 00:02:57.000
[Bleep]

00:02:57.000 --> 00:02:59.601
[ Laughter ]

00:03:02.734 --> 00:03:05.033
-Did you...?
-No.

00:03:05.033 --> 00:03:07.067
-That was creepy,
that little dude.

00:03:07.067 --> 00:03:08.434
That little dude was creepy.

00:03:08.434 --> 00:03:10.267
I think -- I think you might
have lost that one again,

00:03:10.267 --> 00:03:12.200
