00:03:13.767 --> 00:03:16.367
[ Laughter ]

00:03:16.367 --> 00:03:18.067
-You look like you got shot
with a pellet gun.

00:03:18.067 --> 00:03:19.667
-You're cold as ice, man.
Alright.

00:03:19.667 --> 00:03:21.534
I think you're going to
win this one, man.

00:03:21.534 --> 00:03:25.167
2 points here. Alright.

00:03:25.167 --> 00:03:26.901
Ready for another one?

00:03:26.901 --> 00:03:28.367
-I'm-a win this.

00:03:28.367 --> 00:03:29.567
-Mm-hmm. Mm-hmm.
-Alright.

00:03:29.567 --> 00:03:31.434
