00:03:42.534 --> 00:03:45.300
Hm.

00:03:45.300 --> 00:03:48.434
Hm. Hm. Ehh!

00:03:48.434 --> 00:03:51.100
Don't hit the wall!

00:03:51.167 --> 00:03:52.868
Don't hit the wall.

00:03:52.868 --> 00:03:55.234
Ahh!

